  "title": "Football’s weekend was defined by decisive individual moments",
  "summary": "The weekend’s football results show how quickly elite matches can turn on a handful of moments. Hoffenheim’s 3–0 win over Leverkusen was emphatic, Mbappe’s double settled a Clasico headline, and Como’s preparation for Manchester United has made the upcoming tie a story before kick-off. The common thread is competitive volatility: reputations create the stage, but finishing, structure and execution decide the result.",
